        "official_en_sha256": "eb1d86bf70e9a6790fd34073eeb1da303b76c9646be5ee189f52acff6f399f8c"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この世界に飛ばされたせいで\r\n俺は家族と離れ離れになった。",
        "official_en": "Yes. After the battle, I was flung into this world—torn away from my family.",
        "real_en": "Being sent to this world tore me away from my family."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
