      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ならば、それをぶつけ合うしかないのだ。\r\n互いに命を懸けて。",
        "official_en": "If so, then we have no choice but to battle. Till one of us ceases to draw breath.",
        "real_en": "Then we have no choice but to put those reasons to the test, risking our lives."
