      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "シドが悲しみに\r\n縛られてることはわかった……。",
        "official_en": "I see now, Cid. You’ve been swallowed whole by your sadness...",
        "real_en": "I understand now, Cid. You're bound by grief..."
