        "official_en_sha256": "7f8406aa1105b8e3722207202e79b1caa47becabd7777c12597346c0cff595d1"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "家族が手の届かない場所で自分より先に老いて死ぬ。\r\nこれ以上の悲しみがあるだろうか……。",
        "official_en": "My family have aged and died in a place far beyond my reach. Is there any greater sorrow for a man to bear?",
        "real_en": "My family grew old and died before me, somewhere far beyond my reach. Could there be any greater sorrow...?"
      },
